('3cdf1aa2-dd47-578e-9a01-c8f5cd5c85a5'::uuid,'est2','"Statistics, Probability & Data Analysis"'::jsonb,'medium','mcq','"[Table: CP-c24-24 — Scientists at Companies A and B: Company A (Has spoken at conferences before 40, Has not 80); Company B (30, 120)]\nA national conference invites scientists from certain research companies to speak on advancements in their field. The table summarizes the prior speaking experiences of scientists at two research companies that will be represented at the conference. A scientist from company A is randomly selected to be its representative at the conference, and a scientist from company B is randomly selected to be its representative. The probability that company A''s representative has spoken at conferences before is how much greater than the probability that company B''s representative has spoken at conferences before?"'::jsonb,'[{"key":"A","text":"2/15"},{"key":"B","text":"1/4"},{"key":"C","text":"3/10"},{"key":"D","text":"1/3"}]'::jsonb,'{"source":"Kimi Agent Math PDF Question Bank (4)","source_file":"panda.md","source_sha256":"e120378a8127836a41962876a763889bbb1df92d70c90242206130acfa43e008","source_question_id":"CP-c24-24","import_batch":"est2-kimi-bank-2026-09-21","curriculum_lesson":"Statistics, Probability & Data Analysis","image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xxx64220-debug/ghoneem-math-portal/main/assets/question-bank/CP-c24-24.png","image_alt":"Original graph, diagram, or table for CP-c24-24","visual_verified":true}'::jsonb,'"A"'::jsonb,'"Source-keyed answer from panda.md (CP-c24-24)."'::jsonb),
